      <preface>
        <p>
          This cookbook integrates various topics in probability theory and statistics.
          It provides a succinct representation of various topics, offering a comprehensive
          mathematical reference reduced to its essence, rather than aiming for elaborate explanations.
        </p>
        <p>
          The content is based on literature and in-class material from courses of the
          statistics department at the University of California in Berkeley.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you find errors or have suggestions for improvements, please visit
          <url href="http://statistics.zone">http://statistics.zone</url>.
        </p>
      </preface>
    </frontmatter>

